(The primary purpose of this project is the digital transformation of traditional restaurant operations: replacing physical paper) Tj
T* (menus with an interactive, mobile-first QR table ordering suite. When customers scan the table QR code, all restaurant) Tj
T* (offerings \(food, hot/cold drinks, appetizers, desserts, daily specials\) appear instantly with real-time stock availability. The) Tj
T* (platform equips administrators with full CRUD and hide/show controls, while granting waitstaff dedicated operational access.) Tj
